==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Spearow|145}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Glide''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Delta Species|Swellow|32}} from the {{TCG|EX Delta Species}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

